python main.py "Create the full frontend for the AMIPDH Network Health Checker. React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS + TanStack Query + Axios. The UI connects to the backend API at /api/v1 with these endpoints: POST /checks/http (single URL check), POST /checks/egress (multi-URL, max 50), POST /checks/dns (A/AAAA lookup), POST /checks/tcp (socket test), GET /health/live, GET /health/ready. Match the backend Pydantic schemas exactly for TypeScript interfaces. Form validation must enforce: timeout 0.5-30s, port 1-65535, hostname max 253 chars, expected_status 100-599, record_type A or AAAA dropdown. Dashboard page with tabs for each check type. Health page auto-refreshes every 30s. Use VITE_API_BASE_URL env var for the API base URL."
